{"source_clause": "(b) Wages

For purposes of this chapter, the term "wages" means all remuneration for employment, including the cash value of all remuneration (including benefits) paid in any medium other than cash; except that such term shall not include-

    (1) that part of the remuneration which, after remuneration (other than remuneration referred to in the succeeding paragraphs of this subsection) equal to $7,000 with respect to employment has been paid to an individual by an employer during any calendar year, is paid to such individual by such employer during such calendar year;

    ", "local_scope": "Compute the total remuneration included by the annual-limit part3306(b)(1) for the supplied relation. Other statutory exclusions are outside this local component; qualifications supplies candidate admission. Do not claim a complete3306 predictor.", "input_relations": {"payments": {"columns": ["payment_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY", "payer TEXT", "payee TEXT", "payment_year INTEGER", "service_id TEXT", "amount INTEGER"], "meaning": "Each row is one physical payment of nonnegative gross remuneration, directly paid by this payer/employer to this payee/individual in the stated payment calendar year. Different payment IDs are different physical payments even when all other values coincide."}, "qualifications": {"columns": ["payment_id TEXT", "witness_id TEXT"], "meaning": "Each row is a proof witness that the referenced payment is admitted as a candidate for this local component. Several independent proof witnesses may refer to the same physical payment; a missing witness supplies no admission. This is not an additional payment relation."}}, "requested_output": "One integer: total remuneration included by the quoted local annual-limit provision across all supplied payments. An empty input must give0. No case facts, native queries, labels, audit examples, reference query or programme are supplied."}
